{"step": 7, "raw_content": "Now I understand the full picture. The `load_retry_policy()` returns hardcoded defaults and ignores the TOML file. I need to make `load_invoice_retry_policy()` read the `[invoice_retry]` section from `configs/retry_policy.toml`.\n\nThe task says: \"Make `load_invoice_retry_policy` use the `invoice_retry` TOML section while preserving defaults of 30 seconds, 5 attempts, and multiplier 2 when the file or values are absent.\"\n\nI'll modify `load_invoice_retry_policy` to read the TOML file directly. Python 3.11 has `tomllib` in the stdlib. Let me implement this.", "native_tool_calls": [{"call_id": "step-7-call-1", "provider_call_id": "call_00_eErBuQmC9AVHAJ5LhzNS9176", "name": "apply_patch", "arguments": {"edits": [{"path": "src/billing/retries.py", "content": "\"\"\"Invoice retry policy.\"\"\"\n\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\ntry:\n    import tomllib\nexcept ModuleNotFoundError:  # pragma: no cover - Python < 3.11\n    import tomli as tomllib  # type: ignore[no-redef]\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass InvoiceRetryPolicy:\n    initial_delay_seconds: int\n    max_attempts: int\n    backoff_multiplier: int\n\n\ndef load_invoice_retry_policy() -> InvoiceRetryPolicy:\n    raw = _load_invoice_retry_section()\n    return InvoiceRetryPolicy(\n        initial_delay_seconds=raw.get(\"initial_delay_seconds\", 30),\n        max_attempts=raw.get(\"max_attempts\", 5),\n        backoff_multiplier=raw.get(\"backoff_multiplier\", 2),\n    )\n\n\ndef _load_invoice_retry_section() -> dict:\n    path = Path(\"configs\") / \"retry_policy.toml\"\n    if not path.is_file():\n        return {}\n    with path.open(\"rb\") as file:\n        data = tomllib.load(file)\n    return data.get(\"invoice_retry\", {})\n"}]}}], "dialect": null, "canonical_payload": {"tool_calls": [{"name": "apply_patch", "arguments": {"edits": [{"path": "src/billing/retries.py", "content": "\"\"\"Invoice retry policy.\"\"\"\n\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\ntry:\n    import tomllib\nexcept ModuleNotFoundError:  # pragma: no cover - Python < 3.11\n    import tomli as tomllib  # type: ignore[no-redef]\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass InvoiceRetryPolicy:\n    initial_delay_seconds: int\n    max_attempts: int\n    backoff_multiplier: int\n\n\ndef load_invoice_retry_policy() -> InvoiceRetryPolicy:\n    raw = _load_invoice_retry_section()\n    return InvoiceRetryPolicy(\n        initial_delay_seconds=raw.get(\"initial_delay_seconds\", 30),\n        max_attempts=raw.get(\"max_attempts\", 5),\n        backoff_multiplier=raw.get(\"backoff_multiplier\", 2),\n    )\n\n\ndef _load_invoice_retry_section() -> dict:\n    path = Path(\"configs\") / \"retry_policy.toml\"\n    if not path.is_file():\n        return {}\n    with path.open(\"rb\") as file:\n        data = tomllib.load(file)\n    return data.get(\"invoice_retry\", {})\n"}]}, "runtime_call_id": "step-7-call-1", "provider_call_id": "call_00_eErBuQmC9AVHAJ5LhzNS9176"}]}, "parse_error": null, "model": "deepseek-v4-pro", "provider": "openai-compatible", "response_id": "458599cf-4bb1-473d-bd4c-dd17debcd911", "finish_state": "tool_calls", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "actual_response_mode": "native_tools", "incomplete_reason": null, "system_fingerprint": "a307abda487cd1b463329ccb945ce396", "input_tokens": 6574, "output_tokens": 541}
